<title>ABU DHABI: SOCCER-ASIAN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ASIAN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Asian Cup soccer</p>
<p>tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Third place play-off</p>
<p>Iran 1 Kuwait 1 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iran - Ali Daei 40</p>
<p>Kuwait - Jassem Al-Houwaidi 15</p>
<p>Attendence: 45,000</p>
<p>Iran won 3-2 on penalties</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>United Arab Emirates 0 Saudi Arabia 0 - after extra time</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia won 4-2 on penalties.</p>
</text>
